                            <comment id="15213238" author="iveselovskiy" created="Sat, 26 Mar 2016 23:10:05 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/580&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/580&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;All tests seem to pass, except org.apache.ignite.internal.processors.igfs.IgfsTaskSelfTest that hangs. (Not sure if that is somehow related to the changes made).&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15213977" author="vozerov" created="Mon, 28 Mar 2016 08:53:39 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Ivan,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Our experience with create/append in PRIMARY mode shows that it is a bad idea to mix them together. Moreover, dual-mode tasks require significant review and re-design. &lt;br/&gt;
For this reason I would prefer that we do not refactor anything now. I assume that the fix itself is easy, so please apply only the fix to existing code base and remove refactoring.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Vladimir.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15218538" author="iveselovskiy" created="Wed, 30 Mar 2016 18:30:25 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;fix re-done with the latest directions.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15324059" author="vozerov" created="Fri, 10 Jun 2016 08:18:46 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Test still fails.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15329607" author="iveselovskiy" created="Tue, 14 Jun 2016 14:48:37 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;This problem is fixed in 1.7+ (master branch). It was not fixed in gg-7.5.26 . It can potentially be backported to those branches , but likely not alone but with a bunch of other IGFS fixes it depends on.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
